{"id":26671,"author":"Zeeb","body":"\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cu\u003eIntroduction\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u0026nbsp;Hello everyone, today I will share my \u003cu\u003ePublic Scrimmage Server\u003c/u\u003e. It is based on Overcast Network scrimmages and I'm plannig to add some Avicus maps if I get permission. Since OCN died\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;I want to let the OCN users over here to know they have a place where to play scrimmages with its teams. This is not advertisment since my server is not a network, just a scrimmage server.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cu\u003eServer IP:\u003c/u\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; s21.hosthorde.com:26168\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp;-\u003cu\u003e\u003c/u\u003e \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u003cu\u003eVersion:\u003c/u\u003e \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp;\u003ci\u003e1.9 / 1.10 / 1.11\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cu\u003eRanks\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003eApply for the Setter rank here:\u0026nbsp;\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://goo.gl/okAUvK\" title=\"Link: https://goo.gl/okAUvK\"\u003e\u003cb\u003ehttps://goo.gl/okAUvK\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;. With this rank you can set maps, cycle\u0026nbsp;and do every match-related commands.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003eApply for Staff here:\u0026nbsp;\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://goo.gl/kZOacS\" title=\"Link: https://goo.gl/kZOacS\"\u003ehttps://goo.gl/kZOacS\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003e. If you get accepted you will receive Junior Mod rank, as a trial staff. With this rank you can warn,\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003emute\u0026nbsp;and kick. Instructions will be shared to you if you get accepted.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cu\u003eRules\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003eWe follow Overcast Network \u0026amp; Avicus rules. If you break any rule you will get punished. Simple.\u003c/font\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eAnd yes, we do screenshares. Use /report if you think someone's cheating\u0026nbsp;and we will consider to do a screenshare to that player.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e","body_tagged":"\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cu\u003eIntroduction\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u